START

    OPEN the accident records CSV file

    READ all accident records
    STORE the records as a list of dictionaries

    CHECK the unique accident causes

    STANDARDIZE the accident causes
        REMOVE extra spaces
        CAPITALIZE the first letter of each word

    CONVERT vehicles_involved to integer
    CONVERT casualties to integer

    CREATE an empty list called valid_records
    CREATE an empty list called invalid_records

    FOR each accident record

        CREATE an empty list called reasons

        IF vehicles involved is less than 0
            ADD "Vehicles involved cannot be negative" to reasons
        END IF

        IF casualties is less than 0
            ADD "Casualties cannot be negative" to reasons
        END IF

        IF severity is not Minor, Serious or Fatal
            ADD "Invalid severity" to reasons
        END IF

        IF location is empty
            ADD "Location is missing" to reasons
        END IF

        IF cause is empty
            ADD "Cause is missing" to reasons
        END IF

        IF time period is empty
            ADD "Time period is missing" to reasons
        END IF

        IF reasons is empty
            ADD record to valid_records
        ELSE
            ADD record and reasons to invalid_records
        END IF

    END FOR


    CALCULATE total accidents
        COUNT the valid records

    CALCULATE total casualties
        ADD casualties from each valid record


    COUNT accidents by severity

    COUNT accidents by cause

    IDENTIFY the most common cause


    COUNT accidents by location

    CALCULATE total casualties for each location

    IDENTIFY location or locations with most accidents

    IDENTIFY location or locations with most casualties


    COUNT accidents by time period

    IDENTIFY time period or periods with most accidents


    COUNT fatal accidents

    CALCULATE percentage of fatal accidents


    DEFINE function to view accident records

    DEFINE function to analyse severity

    DEFINE function to analyse causes

    DEFINE function to analyse locations and time periods

    DEFINE function to view invalid records

    DEFINE function to display safety summary


    DISPLAY menu

    WHILE user has not selected Exit

        DISPLAY:
            1. View accident records
            2. Analyse severity
            3. Analyse causes
            4. Analyse locations and time periods
            5. View invalid records
            6. View safety summary
            7. Exit

        GET user's choice

        IF choice is 1
            CALL view accident records function

        ELSE IF choice is 2
            CALL analyse severity function

        ELSE IF choice is 3
            CALL analyse causes function

        ELSE IF choice is 4
            CALL analyse locations and time periods function

        ELSE IF choice is 5
            CALL view invalid records function

        ELSE IF choice is 6
            CALL safety summary function

        ELSE IF choice is 7
            DISPLAY "Exiting the program"
            BREAK the loop

        ELSE
            DISPLAY "Invalid selection Choose a number between 1 and 7"
            RETURN to the menu

        END IF

    END WHILE

END
